# 24. FACT VS INTERPRETATION

Separate:

### FACT

> Company announced a new manufacturing facility.

### COMPANY CLAIM

> Management expects the facility to increase capacity by X%.

### EXTERNAL ANALYSIS

> Industry publication estimates demand could increase.

### AI INTERPRETATION

> The development could be relevant to future capacity, but commissioning and utilization remain key variables.

### UNVERIFIED

> Social-media users are speculating about...

Never mix these categories.

---

# 25. MATERIALITY ENGINE

Every detected event should receive:

### HIGH

Potentially material to business/financial outlook.

### MEDIUM

Relevant but limited immediate impact.

### LOW

Informational/no meaningful financial implication.

The daily report should prioritize:

HIGH
+
MEDIUM

Avoid news overload.

